#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:105
msgid ""
"Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and "
"set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the "
"month resets."
msgstr ""
"Mipaka ya Tafsiri: kudhibiti ni majukumu ya aina gani za watumiaji wanaweza "
"kuanzisha tafsiri ya AI, na kuweka bajeti ya token kwa mwezi. Kupita bajeti "
"kunasababisha kusitisha simu za AI hadi mwezi ujao utakapobadilika."

